.05, "PCF_Ratio": 13}}');
INSERT INTO public.funds (productnum, tickersym, quotemode, geozone, shortlabel, fulldescription, currencybase, strategytype, capsize, parentgroup, listingvenue, productclass, networth, yieldrate, launchdate, turnoverratio, strategynotes, expensenet, benchmarkexp, vol3m, volrecent, ma50, ma200, equityweight, bondweight, pb_ratio, pcf_ratio, pe_ratio, ps_ratio, avgmaturity, duration, fundclass, fundmetrics, tradingdata, allocweights, valuationratios) VALUES (739, 'FSST', 'ETF', 'United States', 'MID CAP CORE EQUITY FUND - INST', 'Cavanal Hill Mid Cap Diverse Leadership Fund Institutional Shares', 'usd', NULL, NULL, 'Cavanal Hill funds', 'PCX', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2021-06-15', NULL, 'The investment seeks total return. To pursue its objective, under normal circumstances, the fund invests at least 80% of its net assets in a diversified portfolio of common stocks of Mid Cap U.S. companies that demonstrate governance diversity and leadership. It may also invest up to 20% of its net assets in preferred stocks and cash equivalents, and without regard to governance diversity and leadership ESG criteria.', 0.0059, NULL, 5506, 3820, 21.792, 21.229, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"Cap_Size": null, "Quote_Mode": "ETF", "Currency_Base": "usd", "GeoZone_Class": "United States", "Strategy_Type": null}', '{"Net_Worth": null, "Yield_Rate": null, "Expense_Net": 0.0059, "Benchmark_Exp": null, "Turnover_Ratio": null}', '{"volume_metrics": {"Vol_3M": 5506, "Vol_Recent": 3820}, "moving_averages": {"MA_50": 21.792, "MA_200": 21.229}}', '{"asset_allocation": {"Bond_Weight": null, "Equity_Weight": null}, "bond_characteristics": {"Avg_Maturity": null, "Duration_Yrs": null}}', '{"valuation_metrics": {"PB_Ratio": null, "PE_Ratio": null, "PS_Ratio": null, "PCF_Ratio": null}}');
INSERT INTO public.funds (productnum, tickersym, quotemode, geozone, shortlabel, fulldescription, currencybase, strategytype, capsize, parentgroup, listingvenue, productclass, networth, yieldrate, launchdate, turnoverratio, strategynotes, expensenet, benchmarkexp, vol3m, volrecent, ma50, ma200, equityweight, bondweight, pb_ratio, pcf_ratio, pe_ratio, ps_ratio, avgmaturity, duration, fundclass, fundmetrics, tradingdata, allocweights, valuationratios) VALUES (681, 'FLRN', 'ETF', 'us', 'American Funds Investment Co of', 'American Funds Investment Company of America Class F-1', 'usd', NULL, NULL, 'American Funds', 'PCX', 'Ultrashort Bond', 2481560576, 0.006, '2011-11-30', 0.27, 'The investment seeks long-term growth of capital and income. The fund invests primarily in common stocks, most of which have a history of paying dividends. It may invest up to 15% of its assets, at the time of purchase, in securities of issuers domiciled outside the United States. Although the fund focuses on investments in medium to larger capitalization companies, the fund''s investments are not limited to a particular capitalization size.', 0.0015, 0.0022, 479190, 796190, 30.631, 30.637, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1.71, 0.09, '{"Cap_Size": null, "Quote_Mode": "ETF", "Currency_Base": "usd", "GeoZone_Class": "us", "Strategy_Type": null}', '{"Net_Worth": 2481560576, "Yield_Rate": 0.006, "Expense_Net": 0.0015, "Benchmark_Exp": 0.0022, "Turnover_Ratio": 0.27}', '{"volume_metrics": {"Vol_3M": 479190, "Vol_Recent": 796190}, "moving_averages": {"MA_50": 30.631, "MA_200": 30.637}}', '{"asset_allocation": {"Bond_Weight": null, "Equity_Weight": null}, "bond_characteristics": {"Avg_Maturity": 1.71, "Duration_Yrs": 0.09}}', '{"valuation_metrics": {"PB_Ratio": null, "PE_Ratio": null, "PS_Ratio": null, "PCF_Ratio": null}}');
INSERT INTO public.funds (productnum, tickersym, quotemode, geozone, shortlabel, fulldescription, currencybase, strategytype, capsize, parentgroup, listingvenue, productclass, networth, yieldrate, launchdate, turnoverratio, strategynotes, expensenet, benchmarkexp, vol3m, volrecent, ma50, ma200, equityweight, bondweight, pb_ratio, pcf_ratio, pe_ratio, ps_ratio, avgmaturity, duration, fundclass, fundmetrics, tradingdata, allocweights, valuationratios) VALUES (650, 'FLEE', 'ETF', 'UNITED_STATES', 'American Beacon AHL TargetRisk ', 'American Beacon AHL TargetRisk Fund A', 'Dollar', 'Blend', 'Large', 'American Beacon', 'PCX', NULL, 250381856, 0.0164, '2017-11-02', 0.05, 'The investment seeks capital growth. The fund seeks to achieve its investment objective by allocating all or substantially all of its assets across equities, bonds (including inflation index-linked bonds), interest rates, corporate credit, and commodities primarily through derivative instruments. It invests primarily in futures (including bond futures and government bond futures, such as treasury futures), swaps (including commodity swaps, credit default swaps, cross-currency swaps, interest rate swaps, and total return swaps) and forward contracts, but also may invest in other types of derivative instruments. The fund is non-diversified.', 0.0009, NULL, 14840, 5380, 29.173, 28.877, 0.9969, 0, 1.99, 11.09, 21.65, 1.6, NULL, NULL, '{"Cap_Size": "Large", "Quote_Mode": "ETF", "Currency_Base": "Dollar", "GeoZone_Class": "UNITED_STATES", "Strategy_Type": "Blend"}', '{"Net_Worth": 250381856, "Yield_Rate": 0.0164, "Expense_Net": 0.0009, "Benchmark_Exp": null, "Turnover_Ratio": 0.05}', '{"volume_metrics": {"Vol_3M": 14840, "Vol_Recent": 5380}, "moving_averages": {"MA_50": 29.173, "MA_200": 28.877}}', '{"asset_allocation": {"Bond_Weight": 0, "Equity_Weight": 0.9969}, "bond_characteristics": {"Avg_Maturity": null, "Duration_Yrs": null}}', '{"valuation_metrics": {"PB_Ratio": 1.99, "PE_Ratio": 21.65, "PS_Ratio": 1.6, "PCF_Ratio": 11.09}}');
INSERT INTO public.funds (productnum, tickersym, quotemode, geozone, shortlabel, fulldescription, currencybase, strategytype, capsize, parentgroup, listingvenue, productclass, networth, yieldrate, launchdate, turnoverratio, strategynotes, expensenet, benchmarkexp, vol3m, volrecent, ma50, ma200, equityweight, bondweight, pb_ratio, pcf_ratio, pe_ratio, ps_ratio, avgmaturity, duration, fundclass, fundmetrics, tradingdata, allocweights, valuationratios) VALUES (676, 'FLQH', 'ETF', 'U.S.', 'Cavanal Hill Bond Fund Insti Sh', 'Cavanal Hill Bond Fund Institutional Class', 'Usd', 'Blend', 'Large', 'Cavanal Hill funds', 'PCX', 'Foreign Large Blend', 16742724, 0.0052, '2016-06-01', 0.4233, 'The investment seeks total return. The fund invests at least 80% of its net assets in bonds. It invests primarily in debt obligations such as bonds, notes and debentures, and bills issued by U.S. corporations or by the U.S. government, its agencies, or instrumentalities, municipal securities, mortgage-backed securities, asset-backed securities, collateralized mortgage obligations and fixed income ETFs. The fund also invests in money market instruments.', 0.004, 0.0037, 1567, 4620, 28.378, 27.894, 0.998, 0, 2.39, 10.54, 18.19, 1.92, NULL, NULL, '{"Cap_Size": "Large", "Quote_Mode": "ETF", "Currency_Base": "Usd", "GeoZone_Class": "U.S.", "Strategy_Type": "Blend"}', '{"Net_Worth": 16742724, "Yield_Rate": 0.0052, "Expense_Net": 0.004, "Benchmark_Exp": 0.0037, "Turnover_Ratio": 0.4233}', '{"volume_metrics": {"Vol_3M": 1567, "Vol_Recent": 4620}, "moving_averages": {"MA_50": 28.378, "MA_200": 27.894}}', '{"asset_allocation": {"Bond_Weight": 0, "Equity_Weight": 0.998}, "bond_characteristics": {"Avg_Maturity": null, "Duration_Yrs": null}}', '{"valuation_metrics": {"PB_Ratio": 2.39, "PE_Ratio": 18.19, "PS_Ratio": 1.92, "PCF_Ratio": 10.54}}');
