 "PCF_Ratio": 8.29}}');
INSERT INTO public.funds (productnum, tickersym, quotemode, geozone, shortlabel, fulldescription, currencybase, strategytype, capsize, parentgroup, listingvenue, productclass, networth, yieldrate, launchdate, turnoverratio, strategynotes, expensenet, benchmarkexp, vol3m, volrecent, ma50, ma200, equityweight, bondweight, pb_ratio, pcf_ratio, pe_ratio, ps_ratio, avgmaturity, duration, fundclass, fundmetrics, tradingdata, allocweights, valuationratios) VALUES (1969, 'VIRS', 'ETF', 'US', 'iShares Edge MSCI Min Vol USA I', 'iShares Edge MSCI Min Vol USA Index Fund Class K', 'US Dollar', 'Blend', 'Large', 'BlackRock', 'BTS', 'Large Blend', 4767639, 0.0076, '2020-06-24', 0.05, 'The investment seeks to track the investment results of the MSCI USA Minimum Volatility (USD) Index composed of U.S. equities that, in the aggregate, have lower volatility characteristics relative to the broader U.S. equity market. The fund generally invests at least 80% of its assets, plus the amount of any borrowing for investment purposes, in securities of the underlying index. The index measures the performance of equity securities that are in the top 85% by market capitalization of equity securities primarily traded on stock exchanges in the United States and that, in the aggregate, have lower volatility relative to the broader U.S. equity market.', 0.007, 0.0036, 2798, 1790, 33.713, 31.767, 0.9982, 0, 6.08, 16.98, 26.9, 2.02, NULL, NULL, '{"Cap_Size": "Large", "Quote_Mode": "ETF", "Currency_Base": "US Dollar", "GeoZone_Class": "US", "Strategy_Type": "Blend"}', '{"Net_Worth": 4767639, "Yield_Rate": 0.0076, "Expense_Net": 0.007, "Benchmark_Exp": 0.0036, "Turnover_Ratio": 0.05}', '{"volume_metrics": {"Vol_3M": 2798, "Vol_Recent": 1790}, "moving_averages": {"MA_50": 33.713, "MA_200": 31.767}}', '{"asset_allocation": {"Bond_Weight": 0, "Equity_Weight": 0.9982}, "bond_characteristics": {"Avg_Maturity": null, "Duration_Yrs": null}}', '{"valuation_metrics": {"PB_Ratio": 6.08, "PE_Ratio": 26.9, "PS_Ratio": 2.02, "PCF_Ratio": 16.98}}');
INSERT INTO public.funds (productnum, tickersym, quotemode, geozone, shortlabel, fulldescription, currencybase, strategytype, capsize, parentgroup, listingvenue, productclass, networth, yieldrate, launchdate, turnoverratio, strategynotes, expensenet, benchmarkexp, vol3m, volrecent, ma50, ma200, equityweight, bondweight, pb_ratio, pcf_ratio, pe_ratio, ps_ratio, avgmaturity, duration, fundclass, fundmetrics, tradingdata, allocweights, valuationratios) VALUES (1970, 'VIXM', 'ETF', 'US', 'Banks UltraSector ProFund, Inve', 'ProFunds Banks UltraSector Fund Investor Class', 'usd', NULL, NULL, 'ProFunds', 'BTS', 'Trading--Miscellaneous', 91140352, NULL, '2011-01-03', NULL, 'The investment seeks daily investment results, before fees and expenses, that correspond to one and one-half times (1.5x) the daily performance of the Dow Jones U.S. BanksSM Index. The fund invests in financial instruments that the adviser believes, in combination, should produce daily returns consistent with its investment objective. The index seeks to measure the performance of certain companies in the banking sector of the U.S. equity market. The fund is non-diversified.', 0.0087, 0.0087, 99623, 148400, 30.977, 32.77, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"Cap_Size": null, "Quote_Mode": "ETF", "Currency_Base": "usd", "GeoZone_Class": "US", "Strategy_Type": null}', '{"Net_Worth": 91140352, "Yield_Rate": null, "Expense_Net": 0.0087, "Benchmark_Exp": 0.0087, "Turnover_Ratio": null}', '{"volume_metrics": {"Vol_3M": 99623, "Vol_Recent": 148400}, "moving_averages": {"MA_50": 30.977, "MA_200": 32.77}}', '{"asset_allocation": {"Bond_Weight": null, "Equity_Weight": null}, "bond_characteristics": {"Avg_Maturity": null, "Duration_Yrs": null}}', '{"valuation_metrics": {"PB_Ratio": null, "PE_Ratio": null, "PS_Ratio": null, "PCF_Ratio": null}}');
INSERT INTO public.funds (productnum, tickersym, quotemode, geozone, shortlabel, fulldescription, currencybase, strategytype, capsize, parentgroup, listingvenue, productclass, networth, yieldrate, launchdate, turnoverratio, strategynotes, expensenet, benchmarkexp, vol3m, volrecent, ma50, ma200, equityweight, bondweight, pb_ratio, pcf_ratio, pe_ratio, ps_ratio, avgmaturity, duration, fundclass, fundmetrics, tradingdata, allocweights, valuationratios) VALUES (1972, 'VLU', 'ETF', 'usa', 'iShares Developed Real Estate I', 'iShares Developed Real Estate Index Fund Class K', 'US_DOLLAR', 'Value', 'Large', 'BlackRock', 'PCX', 'Large Value', 215081872, 0.0169, '2012-10-24', 0.16, 'The investment seeks to track the investment results of an index composed of real estate equities in developed markets. The fund seeks to track the investment results of the FTSE EPRA/NAREIT Developed Index, which measures the stock performance of companies engaged in the ownership, disposal and development of income-producing real estate in developed countries as defined by FTSE EPRA/NAREIT. It generally invests at least 90% of its assets, plus the amount of any borrowing for investment purposes, in securities of the underlying index and in depositary receipts representing securities of the underlying index.', 0.0012, 0.0034, 7779, 5800, 150.93, 146.263, 0.9973, 0, 2.41, 11.09, 18.64, 1.41, NULL, NULL, '{"Cap_Size": "Large", "Quote_Mode": "ETF", "Currency_Base": "US_DOLLAR", "GeoZone_Class": "usa", "Strategy_Type": "Value"}', '{"Net_Worth": 215081872, "Yield_Rate": 0.0169, "Expense_Net": 0.0012, "Benchmark_Exp": 0.0034, "Turnover_Ratio": 0.16}', '{"volume_metrics": {"Vol_3M": 7779, "Vol_Recent": 5800}, "moving_averages": {"MA_50": 150.93, "MA_200": 146.263}}', '{"asset_allocation": {"Bond_Weight": 0, "Equity_Weight": 0.9973}, "bond_characteristics": {"Avg_Maturity": null, "Duration_Yrs": null}}', '{"valuation_metrics": {"PB_Ratio": 2.41, "PE_Ratio": 18.64, "PS_Ratio": 1.41, "PCF_Ratio": 11.09}}');
INSERT INTO public.funds (productnum, tickersym, quotemode, geozone, shortlabel, fulldescription, currencybase, strategytype, capsize, parentgroup, listingvenue, productclass, networth, yieldrate, launchdate, turnoverratio, strategynotes, expensenet, benchmarkexp, vol3m, volrecent, ma50, ma200, equityweight, bondweight, pb_ratio, pcf_ratio, pe_ratio, ps_ratio, avgmaturity, duration, fundclass, fundmetrics, tradingdata, allocweights, valuationratios) VALUES (1973, 'VLUE', 'ETF', 'America', 'iShares Total U.S. Stock Market', 'iShares Total U.S. Stock Market Index Fund Class K', 'US$', 'Value', 'Large', 'BlackRock', 'BTS', 'Large Value', 16211961856, 0.0187, '2013-04-16', 0.33, 'The investment seeks to track the investment results of a broad-based index composed of U.S. equities. The fund seeks to track the investment results of the Russell 3000© Index, which measures the performance of the broad U.S. equity market. The underlying index is a float-adjusted capitalization-weighted index of the largest public issuers domiciled in the United States and its territories. The fund generally invests at least 90% of its assets, plus the amount of any borrowing for investment purposes, in securities of the underlying index.', 0.0015, 0.0034, 1263100, 1.40114e+06, 104.23, 104.02, 0.9979, 0, 2.01, 7.88, 17.37, 1.19, NULL, NULL, '{"Cap_Size": "Large", "Quote_Mode": "ETF", "Currency_Base": "US$", "GeoZone_Class": "America", "Strategy_Type": "Value"}', '{"Net_Worth": 16211961856, "Yield_Rate": 0.0187, "Expense_Net": 0.0015, "Benchmark_Exp": 0.0034, "Turnover_Ratio": 0.33}', '{"volume_metrics": {"Vol_3M": 1263100, "Vol_Recent": 1401140}, "moving_averages": {"MA_50": 104.23, "MA_200": 104.02}}', '{"asset_allocation": {"Bond_Weight": 0, "Equity_Weight": 0.9979}, "bond_characteristics": {"Avg_Maturity": null, "Duration_Yrs": null}}', '{"valuation_metrics": {"PB_Ratio": 2.01, "PE_Ratio": 17.37, "PS_Ratio": 1.19, "PCF_Ratio": 7.88}}');
INSERT INTO public.funds (productnum, tickersym, quotemode, geozone, shortlabel, fulldescription, currencybase, strategytype, capsize, parentgroup, listingvenue, productclass, networth, yieldrate, launchdate, turnoverratio, strategynotes, expensenet, benchmarkexp, vol3m, volrecent, ma50, ma200, equityweight, bondweight, pb_ratio, pcf_ratio, pe_ratio, ps_ratio, avgmaturity, duration, fundclass, fundmetrics, tradingdata, allocweights, valuationratios) VALUES (1974, 'VMOT', 'ETF', 'U.S.A.', 'BlackRock Managed Income Fund -', 'BlackRock Managed Income Fund Investor A Shares', 'US_DOLLAR', 'Blend', 'Medium', 'BlackRock', 'BTS', 'Long-Short Equity', 48527556, NULL, '2017-05-02', NULL, 'The investment seeks to maximize current income with consideration for risk-managed total return. The fund may invest up to 100% of its assets in fixed-income securities and up to 30% of its assets in equity securities. It may also gain exposure to such fixed-income securities and equity securities by investing in BlackRock fixed-income and/or equity mutual funds and affiliated and unaffiliated ETFs. With respect to the fund''s fixed-income investments, the fund may invest in fixed-income securities such as corporate bonds and notes, commercial and residential mortgage-backed securities, asset-backed securities, municipal securities, etc.', 0.0175, 0.0095, 2364, 2150, 27.576, 27.503, 0.9905, 0, 2.27, 7.82, 13.47, 1.09, NULL, NULL, '{"Cap_Size": "Medium", "Quote_Mode": "ETF", "Currency_Base": "US_DOLLAR", "GeoZone_Class": "U.S.A.", "Strategy_Type": "Blend"}', '{"Net_Worth": 48527556, "Yield_Rate": null, "Expense_Net": 0.0175, "Benchmark_Exp": 0.0095, "Turnover_Ratio": null}', '{"volume_metrics": {"Vol_3M": 2364, "Vol_Recent": 2150}, "moving_averages": {"MA_50": 27.576, "MA_200": 27.503}}', '{"asset_allocation": {"Bond_Weight": 0, "Equity_Weight": 0.9905}, "bond_characteristics": {"Avg_Maturity": null, "Duration_Yrs": null}}', '{"valuation_metrics": {"PB_Ratio": 2.27, "PE_Ratio": 13.47, "PS_Ratio": 1.09, "PCF_Ratio": 7.82}}');
INSERT INTO public.funds (productnum, tickersym, quotemode, geozone, shortlabel, fulldescription, currencybase, strategytype, capsize, parentgroup, listingvenue, productclass, networth, yieldrate, launchdate, turnoverratio, strategynotes, expensenet, benchmarkexp, vol3m, volrecent, ma50, ma200, equityweight, bondweight, pb_ratio, pcf_ratio, pe_ratio, ps_ratio, avgmaturity, duration, fundclass, fundmetrics, tradingdata, allocweights, valuationratios) VALUES (1975, 'VNLA', 'ETF', 'U.S.A.', 'Lord Abbett Multi-Asset Balance', 'Lord Abbett Multi-Asset Balanced Opportunity Fund Class F', 'US_DOLLAR', NULL, NULL, 'Lord Abbett', 'PCX', 'Ultrashort Bond', 2862166272, 0.009, '2016-11-16', 0.14, 'The investment seeks current income and capital growth. The fund is a "fund-of-funds" that invests in affiliated mutual funds (the "underlying funds") managed by Lord, Abbett & Co. LLC ("Lord Abbett"). Under normal conditions, through the underlying funds, it indirectly invests in U.S. equity securities, fixed income securities and select foreign (including emerging market) securities. The fund uses a "blend" strategy to gain investment exposure to both growth and value stocks, or to stocks with characteristics of both.', 0.0024, 0.0022, 299822, 325080, 50.005, 50.135, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1.01, 0.61, '{"Cap_Size": null, "Quote_Mode": "ETF", "Currency_Base": "US_DOLLAR", "GeoZone_Class": "U.S.A.", "Strategy_Type": null}', '{"Net_Worth": 2862166272, "Yield_Rate": 0.009, "Expense_Net": 0.0024, "Benchmark_Exp": 0.0022, "Turnover_Ratio": 0.14}', '{"volume_metrics": {"Vol_3M": 299822, "Vol_Recent": 325080}, "moving_averages": {"MA_50": 50.005, "MA_200": 50.135}}', '{"asset_allocation": {"Bond_Weight": null, "Equity_Weight": null}, "bond_characteristics": {"Avg_Maturity": 1.01, "Duration_Yrs": 0.61}}', '{"valuation_metrics": {"PB_Ratio": null, "PE_Ratio": null, "PS_Ratio": null, "PCF_Ratio": null}}');
